{
  "comment": "The modes file the engine writes beside the content (/content/.genfleet-modes.json), shared byte-for-byte with the platform. version: an integer >= 1; a later version keeps files as a {path: mode} object and may add keys, which readers ignore. Modes: loaded, data; a mode a reader doesn't know is not loaded. Paths: relative, NFC, '/'-separated, no empty, '.', '..' or hidden segments, no backslash or control characters; every listed path must be a file in the folder. Each case: files on disk, the modes file (an object, or raw text), and the loaded paths or error: true.",
